  "details": "When you first open your menu and click on something, the sound it makes is a lot quieter now. In comparison, the loading screen music is a lot louder now ever since the new patch, unless that was something I did by raising the volume by trying to compensate for the quiet menu noise. Either way, the menu noise is a lot quieter, that much I'm sure of and a friend has also reported the same issue so I know it can't just be me.",
